  "notes": "{尊|たっと}ぶ expresses valuing or respecting something highly.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nVARIANT:\nAlso read as {尊|とうと}ぶ (same meaning). Both readings are correct.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{命|いのち}→命：02371_inochi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尊|たっと}ぶ: to value life\n- ⟦{伝統|でんとう}→伝統：09585_dentou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尊|たっと}ぶ: to respect tradition\n- ⟦{人権|じんけん}→人権：05416_jinken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尊|たっと}ぶ: to value human rights\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{尊|とうと}い→尊い：12399_toutoi⟧/{尊|たっと}い: precious, noble (adjective)\n- ⟦{尊敬|そんけい}する→尊敬する：22429_sonkeisuru⟧: to respect (more common in everyday speech)\n- ⟦{崇|あが}める→崇める：10026_agameru⟧: to worship, to idolize",
